"How People Atlas handles your information" = "关系图谱如何处理你的信息";
"Where your data is stored" = "数据保存在哪里";
"Names, genders, notes, and relationships are stored locally with SwiftData. When iCloud is available, SwiftData also synchronizes them through your private CloudKit database so they can appear on your devices signed in to the same Apple Account." = "姓名、性别、备注和关系通过 SwiftData 保存在本地。iCloud 可用时，SwiftData 还会通过你的私有 CloudKit 数据库同步，使数据显示在登录同一 Apple 账户的设备上。";
"Names, genders, notes, and relationships are stored locally on this device with SwiftData." = "你输入的姓名、性别、备注和关系通过 SwiftData 保存在此设备本地。";
"Data we do not collect" = "我们不收集的数据";
"People Atlas does not operate a developer server, access your contacts, collect analytics, show ads, or track you." = "关系图谱不运营开发者服务器，不访问通讯录，不收集分析数据，不展示广告，也不跟踪你。";
"Backups and deletion" = "备份与删除";
"JSON backups are created only when you export them. They are not encrypted, so store and share them carefully. Deleting a person also deletes their relationships. Importing a backup replaces local data only after you confirm." = "只有在你主动导出时才会创建 JSON 备份。备份文件未加密，请谨慎保存和分享。删除人物会同时删除相关关系；导入备份仅在你确认后替换本地数据。";
"iCloud and other services" = "iCloud 与其他服务";
"iCloud synchronization is provided by Apple and follows your iCloud settings and Apple’s privacy terms. People Atlas has no separate account and does not operate a server that receives your records. Device backups and file-storage services you choose follow their own privacy policies." = "iCloud 同步由 Apple 提供，遵循你的 iCloud 设置及 Apple 隐私条款。关系图谱没有独立账户，也不运营接收这些记录的服务器。设备备份及你选择的文件存储服务适用其各自的隐私政策。";
"Your choices" = "你的选择";
"You can edit or delete your records at any time. Only record personal information you are entitled to use. Removing the app or losing the device can remove local data, so back up regularly." = "你可以随时编辑或删除记录。请仅记录你有权使用的个人信息。卸载应用或丢失设备可能导致本地数据丢失，请定期备份。";
"Privacy questions" = "隐私问题";
"Use the support contact on the App Store product page or support website for privacy questions." = "如有隐私问题，请使用 App Store 产品页面或支持网站中公布的联系方式。";
"Done" = "完成";
"No app account. No tracking. No ads." = "无需应用账号，无跟踪，无广告。";
"People Atlas does not use a developer-operated server, access your contacts, or collect analytics. If iCloud is available, your records sync through Apple’s CloudKit service. You control what you record and share." = "关系图谱不使用开发者运营的服务器，不访问通讯录，也不收集分析数据。iCloud 可用时，你的记录会通过 Apple 的 CloudKit 服务同步。记录和分享均由你掌控。";
